
###  Create .gitignore File
Create a file named `.gitignore` in your project root:
```
# Ignore uploaded files
uploads/profiles/*
uploads/files/*
uploads/images/*
uploads/voice/*
!uploads/profiles/default.png
!uploads/images/default.png

# Ignore system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Ignore sensitive config (optional)
# includes/config.php

# Ignore logs
*.log
error_log

# Ignore IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-*
